  "worked_solution": "Since $X∼{χ}^{2}(7),$ we focus on the row of the table that corresponds to $k=7.$\n\n| $k∖p$ | $0.995$ | $0.990$ | $0.975$ | $0.950$ | $0.900$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $7$ | $\\,0.989\\,$ | $\\,1.239\\,$ | $\\,1.690\\,$ | $\\,2.167\\,$ | $\\,2.833\\,$ |\n\nFrom this row, we see that\n\n$$\nP(X>1.690)=0.975.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our answer is $x=1.690.$",
